id: pm-gh1365
title: "GH-1365: Agent UX: typed update refusals blame valid flags instead of the field that failed validation"
description: "Reported agent-facing contract defect imported from https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1365. Preserve existing shipped foundations. Detailed source observations are dated 2026-09-30 and must be revalidated before implementation."
