acceptance_criteria: "Risk, deadline and missing-ID fixtures identify the actual failure; Permuting valid title/priority flags never changes attribution; Attached values, aliases, multiple invalid inputs and no flagged inputs are covered; Error paths do not mutate item state; Unknown attribution is omitted; legal-domain values correspond to the blamed field; Existing policy-specific missing-field and surface tests remain green"
